/* The painted price sticker panel beside each tier, drawn out of view (the stickers in the game's look
   are part of the catalog page's art). */
#Hud #CitadelHudHeroShop CitadelShopModsFiltered .tierRow .CostSticker
{
	visibility: collapse;
}

files.theme/citadel_shop_mods_recommended.css:
/* Clean: the Recommended tab (Popular Items): a header with the hero's icon, then each price tier's cards
   in three columns (weapon, spirit, vitality) with the tier's price above them. The header becomes a
